<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">petition</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">petition</ansi> command sends a message straight to the staff — use it
for harassment, a player griefing others, a quest you're stuck on, or anything
you need a human to look at. Your name, location, and the time are attached
automatically.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">petition <message></ansi>

  Examples:
    <ansi fg="command">petition A player named Grum keeps following and insulting me.</ansi>
    <ansi fg="command">petition I'm stuck — the gate north won't open after the quest step.</ansi>

Petitions go into a queue the staff review, even if none are online right now.
Please send one at a time.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help bug</ansi>
